        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we offer more complex and value-added scientific research support and production services such as DNA extraction, media preparation, bioreactor servicing and compound management, and cleanroom control, monitoring, maintenance and sanitization.",
